  "description": [
    "Quaternion, Euler Angles, Rotation Vectors and Rotation Matrices - There is no industry standard on rotation parametrization? But why? In my bachelor thesis I analyse & the varying properties of each rotation parametrization and their resulting use cases. In the accompanying unity project I created a visualisation tool, which allows the user to interactively experiment with the theory explained in the thesis. "
